      163.05,
      203.33,
      400.04,
      214.67
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE ROMAN CATHOLIC ARCHBISHOP AND BISHOPS",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      241.53,
      215.93,
      321.69,
      227.27
    ],
    "text": "OF CEYLON ORDINANCE",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      241.13,
      401.42,
      315.47
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a portion of the area hitherto under theecclesiastical jurisdiction of the Roman Catholic Bishop ofTrincomalee has now been created into a new Diocese calledthe Roman Catholic Diocese of Batticaloa and the RightReverend Dr. Joseph Ponniah has been duly appointed theRoman Catholic Bishop of Batticaloa to administer the same:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      329.33,
      401.4,
      378.47
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS it is expedient to amend the RomanCatholic Archbishop and Bishops of Ceylon Ordinance, toprovide for the incorporation of the Roman Catholic Bishopof Batticaloa and in other respects:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      392.33,
      401.36,
      416.27
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      430.13,
      401.39,
      466.67
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Roman CatholicArchbishop and Bishops of Ceylon (Amendment) Act,No. ..... of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      480.53,
      401.43,
      554.87
    ],
    "text": "2.The Roman Catholic Archbishop and Bishops ofCeylon Ordinance ( hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) as last amended by Act, No. 19 of 2000 is herebyfurther amended by the insertion immediately after Section3D of the principal enactment and shall have effect as section3E of the principal enactmant :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      214.89,
      568.73,
      401.41,
      668.27
    ],
    "text": "3E. The Roman Catholic Bishop of Batticaloa,to wit the Right Reverend Dr. Joseph Ponniahand his successors duly appointed accordingto the laws and usages of the Roman CatholicChurch, shall be a body corporate and shall, forall purposes of this Ordinance, have the nameof the Roman Catholic Bishop of Batticaloa,and by such name shall have perpetual",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      432.35,
      445.3,
      441.21
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      242.59,
      442.29,
      251.66
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
